    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "The Stranger is the fifth studio album by American singer-songwriter Billy Joel, released on September 29, 1977, by Columbia Records. It was the first of Joel's albums to be produced by Phil Ramone, with whom he would work for five subsequent albums.\n\nJoel's previous album, Turnstiles (1976), had sold modestly, and peaked at only #122 on the US Billboard 200 charts, prompting Columbia to consider dropping him if his next release sold poorly. Joel wanted the new album to feature his..."
      }
