        "@value": "Music meets movement in this captivating collaboration between Patrick Watson and Yoann Bourgeois. Rooted in a shared belief in the power of imagination and wild ideas, the work offers a hopeful and deeply moving reflection on our world.\n\nFrench choreographer and acrobat Yoann Bourgeois and Canadian singer-songwriter Patrick Watson, alongside five contemporary dancer-acrobats, come together in a mesmerising, gravity-defying production that blends dance, live music, theatre, and contemporary circus. A distinctive set featuring a trampoline, turntable, treadmill, and aquarium creates a..."
      }
    ],
